		(descr "PRPAK3x3-8L (3.3 x 3.35 mm, 0.65 mm pitch; HUASHUO HSBB3072 page 5) land pattern from the Micras Altium library: pad 1 gate, three pads 2 source, pads 3 drain (four leads, exposed pad, two side tabs); paste on F.Paste: the source leads' apertures as drawn, the drain leads, side tabs and exposed pad split, the pad in four windows, 61 % of it (TI SLUA271C 4.4: 50-70 %), the 0.4 mm cross between them holding four thermal-via sites (0.2 mm, on Cmts.User); STEP is the AOS AON7611 DFN 3x3 model, not the exact part")
